Third-party code shipped with Stakeout

- Range.lua adapts the range-checking approach and item lists from
  NameplateDistance 0.4.2 by Nedyar, Copyright (c) 2026 Nedyar, under the MIT
  License. Range.lua includes that copyright and the full permission notice.
