  Spotnick2, under the MIT License. Its own LICENSE is included beside it in
  packaged copies of Stakeout.

Third-party sounds

The MIT terms above cover Stakeout's own code. They do NOT cover the six
alert sounds in Media/, royalty-free sound effects from Pixabay
(https://pixabay.com), used under the Pixabay Content License
(https://pixabay.com/service/terms/). They ship inside Stakeout only and may
not be redistributed as files of their own:

  Media/Sonar.ogg          "sonar ping", Pixabay #95840, freesound_community
  Media/RadarBlip.ogg      "radar ping", Pixabay #306440, user 49053354
  Media/DeepSea.ogg        "deepsea sonar", Pixabay #386156, Dragon Studio
  Media/BellChime.ogg      "clear bell chime", Pixabay #487898, Universfield
  Media/Notification.ogg   "new notification 016", Pixabay #350210,
                           Universfield
  Media/HudPing.ogg        "sci-fi HUD notification ping", Pixabay #547867,
                           vadim_makes_sound

They are NodeRadar's files (github.com/Spotnick2/NodeRadar), each trimmed,
made mono and evened in loudness there.
